Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.29,0:00:07.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looks like it'll be pretty late by the time we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.96,0:00:09.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, Grete.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.54,0:00:11.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, don't apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.08,0:00:14.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If anything, I should be thanking you for\Nspending the whole day with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.75,0:00:18.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thea and the others should be back\Nfrom the mission site by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.13,0:00:21.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everyone's probably waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:23.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This will be the first time in a long while
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.21,0:00:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that we'll have all nine Lamplight\Nmembers back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:26.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm really looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:30.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:34.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would it be all right if we made one more stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.13,0:00:37.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to get something for the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.42,0:00:41.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Closed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:43.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh no...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.25,0:00:46.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Was it all for nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.42,0:00:49.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,All that work we did?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.46,0:00:55.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For the next  little while,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.46,0:00:58.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be staying in the Lylat Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.21,0:01:00.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything too wild,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.58,0:01:02.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and make sure you all get plenty of rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.13,0:01:03.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:09.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.83,0:01:11.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Woohoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.33,0:01:14.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's vacation time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.04,0:01:16.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We have ten whole days off!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.96,0:01:18.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, we've earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:21.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm heading out tomorrow to travel my heart out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.58,0:01:24.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go on an adventure with Erna and Sara, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:28.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nobody told me Annette was\Ngoing to be tagging along!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.38,0:01:31.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't be like that.\NIt'll be more fun with all three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:34.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.71,0:01:37.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're all free to spend our vacations however we want,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.46,0:01:39.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but tonight, we should all have a feast together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.46,0:01:42.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With no Teach and no training, the night is ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.58,0:01:43.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:45.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.50,0:01:48.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that really all the excitement you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.42,0:01:50.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,YAY!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:54.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.46,0:01:58.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case, what do you say to having\None of those meat pies as our main dish?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.63,0:01:59.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Meat pie...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.83,0:02:03.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mean, like the one you got while you were\Nout on that errand the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.38,0:02:06.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.38,0:02:07.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was tasty as heck!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.92,0:02:10.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was blown away, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.21,0:02:12.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.17,0:02:13.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Me three.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.17,0:02:14.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Me four.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.38,0:02:17.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No objections here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.75,0:02:19.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's head over to the shop, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.79,0:02:23.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,While we're out, we can pick up some other food, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.92,0:02:28.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:31.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.42,0:02:34.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are these your friends from seminary school?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:35.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.88,0:02:37.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,May I ask why you aren't open?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.71,0:02:42.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm thinking about closing up shop for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.96,0:02:47.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Smells like raw garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.88,0:02:50.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did someone dump something here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.33,0:02:52.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-you can tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.38,0:02:55.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If it's not a bother,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.08,0:02:57.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,would you mind telling us what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.13,0:03:00.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, you ask, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.17,0:03:01.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It would mean a lot to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.29,0:03:13.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The other day, the president of Mannheim Inc.\Ncame here in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.25,0:03:15.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mannheim?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.58,0:03:17.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The food company?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.00,0:03:20.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like, the one with the radio jingle?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.38,0:03:24.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Ma-Ma-Mannheim's, Fried-Fried Chicken!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.58,0:03:27.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ma-Ma-Mannheim's, Fried-Fri-"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.13,0:03:32.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He wanted me to sell him my meat pie recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.08,0:03:35.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But he only offered me a pittance,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.00,0:03:40.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and it came with the absurd requirement that\NI never sell meat pies from this shop again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.42,0:03:43.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And when you turned him down,\Nthe harassment started.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.75,0:03:45.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.96,0:03:48.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm no spring chicken anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.46,0:03:50.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I don't have anyone to take over the shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:53.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I was thinking that maybe I should\Njust call it quits and sell the recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.67,0:03:58.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This shop has been a beloved\Nlocal institution for ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.92,0:04:04.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are hundreds if not thousands of people\Nwho love your pies,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.00,0:04:06.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and we all count ourselves among them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.29,0:04:10.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's because this place has been\Npassed down for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.42,0:04:13.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But sometimes, that's just the way things go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.58,0:04:17.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those kind words of yours are enough for me, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.38,0:04:26.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That totally killed the mood, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.79,0:04:27.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:34.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It sucks, but them's the breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.88,0:04:37.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What say we find something else for our main dish?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:40.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, we can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.92,0:04:46.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What would the boss do if he were in this situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.13,0:04:48.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What does Klaus have to do with anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.33,0:04:50.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.71,0:04:52.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All righty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.75,0:04:53.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ayup.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.54,0:04:58.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Time to crush Mannheim.\N{\rSubtitle-3}Mannheim's gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.08,0:05:00.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lily, Sybilla...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:02.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's all just hold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.08,0:05:05.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel,\Nbut what exactly do you intend on doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.67,0:05:07.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Poison their president.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.29,0:05:09.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Beat up their president.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.13,0:05:12.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's so crude!\NYou know that's a civilian you're talking about, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.08,0:05:15.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mannheim Inc.'s the one committin' the crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.63,0:05:17.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We have no proof of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.79,0:05:19.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is a major corporation we're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.54,0:05:22.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Its president will have wealth and power in spades,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.08,0:05:26.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and I strongly doubt that he's doing\Nany of the harassment himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:29.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm angry too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.13,0:05:33.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But punishing the president won't do anything\Nto repair the damage he's caused.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.54,0:05:37.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,From the sound of it, the owner's lost\Nhis motivation to keep running the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.75,0:05:38.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.13,0:05:42.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is a problem that we have the power to solve.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.71,0:05:46.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've got a plan, Grete?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.38,0:05:47.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:51.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, it's going to require\Neverybody's help to pull off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.75,0:05:53.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So it's decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:54.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's get started, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:57.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just for the record,\NKlaus told us not to do anything too wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.88,0:05:59.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.08,0:06:00.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Down with Mannheim!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:02.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:21.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When their director of general affairs came to the club,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:24.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,he told me that Mannheim Inc.\Njust had a new president take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.33,0:06:26.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.79,0:06:28.92,Song,,0,0,0,,Itami ga unda daishou\N{\rSong-2}Embrace the toll of pain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.17,0:06:28.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The new guy is an imbecile.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.79,0:06:31.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He trashed their earnings in record time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.92,0:06:36.25,Song,,0,0,0,,Nido to kienai kasabuta wo dakishime\N{\rSong-2}The scabs that will never fade{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.17,0:06:34.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and everyone in the company hates him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.25,0:06:41.63,Song,,0,0,0,,Gouin na sukimakaze ano hi sarawareta\N{\rSong-2}That day, a forceful draft snatched it away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:46.25,Song,,0,0,0,,Kawarenai boku wa oiteikanakucha\N{\rSong-2}Unable to change, I have to leave it behind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.54,0:06:46.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's worried about keeping his position,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.00,0:06:47.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so he wants something that can
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.54,0:06:51.46,Song,,0,0,0,,Nee fuan sae oikoshite\N{\rSong-2}Come, outrace your fear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.67,0:06:49.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,turn the situation around all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.33,0:06:52.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's probably why he's after the recipe, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.46,0:06:54.83,Song,,0,0,0,,Shiranakatta sora to kyou wa kono ashi de\N{\rSong-2}Face the unfamiliar sky and day on your own two feet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:57.67,Song,,0,0,0,,Chouyou wo mukaeyou\N{\rSong-2}And greet the sunrise{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.13,0:07:00.71,Song,,0,0,0,,Fukou ga kureta shiawase\N{\rSong-2}Misfortune gave rise to happiness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.96,0:07:02.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I posed as her and tried snoopin' around their clients.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:03.46,Song,,0,0,0,,Zetsubou no hate ni mieta\N{\rSong-2}You saw a guidepost at the end of despair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.92,0:07:06.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looks like the second-gen idiot
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.46,0:07:08.75,Song,,0,0,0,,Shirube wa ima hitosuji no hi wo tomosu\N{\rSong-2}And now, it's lit with a single flame{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.38,0:07:08.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,made some seedy friends as a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.75,0:07:11.17,Song,,0,0,0,,Karamiau kako wo harae\N{\rSong-2}Shake off the entangled past{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.13,0:07:11.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're probably the ones behind the harassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.17,0:07:19.13,Song,,0,0,0,,Kokoro ga hokorobu basho made aragau\N{\rSong-2}And fight until you find a place your heart can soar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.79,0:07:13.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do they have connections to organized crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.67,0:07:14.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.96,0:07:16.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And there are rumors
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.17,0:07:19.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that the new president secretly carries a gun around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.13,0:07:25.00,Song,,0,0,0,,Ah, shunkan ikinobiro\N{\rSong-2}Ah, surviving through each moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.33,0:07:21.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why no one can stand up to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:26.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll need to make sure this doesn't get out of hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.33,0:07:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks to everyone's hard work,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.50,0:07:33.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we've gathered the intel we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.13,0:07:35.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:40.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Out of all of us, who would you say\Nlooks the most gullible?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.08,0:07:41.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.08,0:07:42.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.29,0:07:43.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then it's unanimous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.33,0:07:48.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, please commit this document to memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.08,0:07:54.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lily, would you mind giving me a\Nfinal check on that backstory?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.13,0:07:55.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.17,0:08:03.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Lily, or rather Lillian,\Nthe granddaughter of the meat pie shop owner
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.58,0:08:06.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,who oh so loves the pies her granddad made.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:11.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He even taught me his recipe\Nso I could take over the shop someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.17,0:08:13.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But alas!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.54,0:08:17.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lillian could never give up on her dream\Nof becoming an actress!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.04,0:08:19.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To pie, or to act?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.63,0:08:22.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After agonizing over it for ages, she left home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.17,0:08:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, she struggles alone in a run-down\Napartment near the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.29,0:08:27.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,working her butt off day in and day out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.21,0:08:32.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, her acting career never took off,\Nand she lives her life in poverty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.88,0:08:36.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh-oh-oh, poor Lillian,\Nyour tale brings a tear to my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.00,0:08:38.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.33,0:08:39.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.88,0:08:42.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's him! The target's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.04,0:08:45.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-the president of Mannheim Inc.?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.00,0:08:47.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But what brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.58,0:08:52.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your adorable little blonde friend\Ntold me your address.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.42,0:08:56.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hear you're a little hard up for cash, Miss Lillian.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.04,0:09:02.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your grandfather taught you\Nthe meat pie recipe, did he not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.46,0:09:04.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My company would love to buy it from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.25,0:09:07.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,S-so, about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.38,0:09:13.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's actually someone else\Nwho wants to buy grandpa's recipe, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.08,0:09:14.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.29,0:09:16.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someone beat me to the punch, did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.42,0:09:19.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, sell it to us anyways!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.46,0:09:22.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll pay you a thousand dents.\NThat'll cover your rent here for three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:24.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.08,0:09:26.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're up, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.29,0:09:27.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:30.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm code name Daughter Dearest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.13,0:09:33.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, let's fill this time with laughter and tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.29,0:09:36.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Plus, if you're willing to become my lover,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.63,0:09:40.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then I'll throw in another two hundred dents a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.00,0:09:41.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll sock you, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:43.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:45.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, there they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.67,0:09:47.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the other pair that wanted to buy the recipe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.46,0:09:50.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:52.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have another visitor, Lillian?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:55.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.13,0:09:58.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You look familiar...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.38,0:10:00.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.58,0:10:01.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.58,0:10:02.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.88,0:10:08.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This here is the world-famous chef\Nknown as the pride of the Lylat Kingdom...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.38,0:10:11.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...Sean Dumont!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.04,0:10:22.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,All in all, there were four traps we set.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.75,0:10:24.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The first was information.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.88,0:10:27.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Thea used the Mannheim director of generals affairs
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.88,0:10:30.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,to let the president know that Lillian existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.96,0:10:32.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The second was the photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.38,0:10:36.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Monika's talent for forgery allowed us\Nto lend credence to our story.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.08,0:10:38.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The third was Erna.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.79,0:10:42.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,She has a tendency to attract\Nvillains and accidents to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.83,0:10:44.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,By taking advantage of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:48.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,we were able to use the president's unsavory friends\Nto indirectly let him know the apartment's address
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.92,0:10:53.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,as well as the fact that Lillian was financially struggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.50,0:10:55.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,And now, the fourth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.58,0:10:57.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?! B-but that's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.75,0:11:01.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sean Dumont is one of the best chefs in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.42,0:11:05.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no way a legend like him would\Ntake an interest in a tiny rural nation like ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.21,0:11:07.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it's true, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.50,0:11:12.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A mere thousand dents for that meat pie recipe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.96,0:11:18.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's sad that a food company's president\Nwould be so inept at judging value.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.13,0:11:18.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.04,0:11:22.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mr. Dumont is prepared to offer you 200,000 dents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.83,0:11:24.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,T-two hundred thousand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:27.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is say yes, Miss Lillian,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.88,0:11:29.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and we'll have the paperwork drawn up right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.46,0:11:35.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, our restaurant is frequented by\Nfamous actors from around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.00,0:11:36.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We would be happy to introduce you to some of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.75,0:11:38.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sold!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:41.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then we have a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:44.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You people think you can just march in here\Nand do whatever the hell you want?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.13,0:11:45.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold on! That recipe is-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.13,0:11:50.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you want to go up against us, then be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.17,0:11:55.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just be warned that all Mr. Dumont has to do\Nis say that Mannheim's food tastes bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.08,0:11:58.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and your company will crumble in the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:03.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The meat pie recipe is ours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.92,0:12:08.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,From now on, make sure you stay away from\NMiss Lillian and her grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:13.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yay! Stage one, complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.88,0:12:18.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All we have to do now is wait for Mannheim's\Npresident to get in touch with Lillian again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.54,0:12:24.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I rigged up a dummy line so the president's call\Nwill come straight here, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.83,0:12:27.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How about that awesome performance I put on, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.08,0:12:29.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought my acting was quite good as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.63,0:12:31.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:33.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Things couldn't have gone better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.04,0:12:34.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Erna?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.58,0:12:35.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.88,0:12:36.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Get away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.92,0:12:38.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.13,0:12:41.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Things always seem to go smoothly\Nwhen you're the one running the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.33,0:12:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's very nice of you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.71,0:12:44.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You sure you aren't pushing yourself, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.29,0:12:48.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting you to put so much into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.92,0:12:52.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The truth is, I visited that pie shop with the boss once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.29,0:12:54.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.29,0:12:56.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You want to tell me about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.96,0:13:04.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.25,0:13:08.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you ever get a chance,\Nyou should check out that shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.75,0:13:09.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.96,0:13:12.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The meat pies there are the best I've ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:16.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're so tasty I actually tried to recreate them once,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.71,0:13:18.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I wasn't able to pull it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.13,0:13:20.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not even with your skills?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.21,0:13:22.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.25,0:13:24.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was able to make something exceedingly close,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.67,0:13:27.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but it wasn't quite the same as the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.75,0:13:31.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The generations of love they've passed down
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.00,0:13:33.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,aren't the kind of thing you can\Nreproduce in a single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.54,0:13:35.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Love, passed down...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:38.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In other words, you're saying that you want me\Nto receive the love you're passing along?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.54,0:13:39.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I am not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.38,0:13:40.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That sounded like a proposal to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.79,0:13:45.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,See, now you're just ignoring my feelings altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.08,0:13:48.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was just a recommendation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.88,0:13:52.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have a lot of memories of going there with Inferno.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.38,0:13:54.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.29,0:13:57.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We ate there as a reward for a mission well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.79,0:14:00.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There was a man named Lukas who loved the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.38,0:14:02.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He and I always fought over the last slice,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.79,0:14:04.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and my mentor would end up scolding us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.46,0:14:09.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll never be able to\Nenjoy their pies that way again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:16.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why I can't let the shop be destroyed\Nwhile the boss is away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.67,0:14:18.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:21.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're going to quite some lengths to protect\Nwhat the person you love cares about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.75,0:14:23.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Am I making a mistake, do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.63,0:14:24.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.04,0:14:26.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.29,0:14:29.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really think Klaus is going to be happy about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.92,0:14:30.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.92,0:14:36.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tell me, did he ever once ask you\Nto protect the meat pie shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.50,0:14:38.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He gave us two instructions, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.79,0:14:41.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Don't do anything too wild," and\N"make sure you get plenty of rest."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.08,0:14:45.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The way I see it,\Nyou've gone and ignored both of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.46,0:14:49.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would Klaus really want us to\Nuse the skills he taught us
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.92,0:14:52.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to shake down some petty lowlife?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.71,0:14:57.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Psych.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:14:58.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.25,0:15:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, chin up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.63,0:15:02.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm just screwing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:06.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't help but get jealous when I see someone\Nbeing all earnest about their love.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.46,0:15:10.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Monika...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.25,0:15:14.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.46,0:15:16.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,President Dumbass fell for it hook, line, and sinker!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.50,0:15:18.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't it weird how soon he called, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.25,0:15:23.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.88,0:15:26.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This wasn't what I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.58,0:15:29.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please hold off on signing that contract\Nwith Sean Dumont, Miss Lillian.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.71,0:15:32.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What? But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:33.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll give you 250,000 dents.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.92,0:15:35.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, sell the recipe to Mannheim Inc.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.96,0:15:37.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,250,000?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.13,0:15:40.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everything up until there went as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.00,0:15:42.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The fact that the recipe had the seal of approval\Nfrom a world-famous chef
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.63,0:15:44.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,would have made the president want it that much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.96,0:15:46.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The plan was, we would sell him a fake recipe
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.96,0:15:50.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and give the money we got to the\Nmeat pie shop owner, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.42,0:15:54.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, I have one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.58,0:15:55.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.29,0:15:57.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.33,0:16:00.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need you to prepare the recipe in front of me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.13,0:16:02.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and make a pie that's the exact same\Nas the ones from the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:05.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, we're boned, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:08.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We don't have any idea what the real recipe is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.63,0:16:09.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:12.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need to procure a genuine meat pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.46,0:16:16.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The problem is, what we're doing is fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.21,0:16:18.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can't let the pie shop owner\Nbecome an accomplice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.96,0:16:21.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yo, Grete, what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.38,0:16:23.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Give up on the cash and walk away?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.42,0:16:27.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Grete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.33,0:16:35.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,According to the story you told me,\Ndidn't Klaus try to recreate the meat pie?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.25,0:16:44.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's an international call for you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.13,0:16:48.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here's the recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.67,0:16:52.29,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,Ingredient set A: ground shoulder roast, onion,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.29,0:16:54.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette, could you fast forward?\N{\rSubtitle-5}carrot, apple, garlic-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.46,0:16:57.63,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,...suitable amounts of each.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.13,0:17:01.38,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,Ingredient set B: bread flour, pastry flour,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.38,0:17:02.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fast forward again.\N{\rSubtitle-5}cornstarch, water-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.63,0:17:04.92,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,...suitable amounts of each.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.08,0:17:06.33,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,Instructions, part one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.33,0:17:11.50,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,Mix A until it becomes the color of a single drop of blue paint\Nspilled into the sun as it sets over Emai Lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.50,0:17:12.50,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,Instructions, part two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.50,0:17:13.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fast forward!\N{\rSubtitle-5}Mix B-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.17,0:17:15.50,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,...part four.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.83,0:17:18.33,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,Once the sear marks become bubbly-crunchy, take it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.33,0:17:19.88,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,Bubbly-crunchiness is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.13,0:17:21.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That concludes the recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.33,0:17:25.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you need it for, but good hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.50,0:17:30.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How the hell are we supposed to follow that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.75,0:17:32.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All the quantities were "suitable amounts."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.75,0:17:36.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In other words, it's the same\N"somehow or other" stuff as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.29,0:17:38.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm all out of ideas, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.54,0:17:40.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, no. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.96,0:17:43.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.46,0:17:45.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is my first vacation with you all,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.88,0:17:48.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and I think I let myself get carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.83,0:17:50.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the boss told us not to do anything too wild
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.71,0:17:52.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,because he thought something like this might happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.29,0:17:54.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Miss Grete...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.25,0:18:00.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted to understand the boss's feelings and\Ndo what I could to support them, but now...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.92,0:18:03.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, you mind fixing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.79,0:18:06.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Good hunting," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.17,0:18:09.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Klaus probably has some idea of what's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:12.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This time, make sure you actually\Nunderstand what he's thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.92,0:18:14.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Monika...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.38,0:18:18.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're the only one who's got any shot\Nof cracking that cipher of a recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.75,0:18:20.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.13,0:18:21.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All righty!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.54,0:18:22.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Down with Mannheim!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.88,0:18:26.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's give this one more push to support Grete's love!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.92,0:18:28.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.21,0:18:36.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It'll be finished in just a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.67,0:18:37.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.54,0:18:41.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! A-a mouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.21,0:18:42.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.54,0:18:48.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.29,0:18:50.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-no, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.79,0:18:58.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mmm, delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.04,0:18:59.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is the shop's pie, for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:02.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm certain this is the real recipe!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.13,0:19:04.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then I guess I'll be taking this money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.33,0:19:07.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm through with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.92,0:19:10.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you're smart, you won't resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.92,0:19:12.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh no, what a bummer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.58,0:19:15.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I really didn't want to have to use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.04,0:19:18.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not against a civvie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.79,0:19:20.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you babbling about-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.63,0:19:25.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did the knockout gas work?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.25,0:19:26.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like a charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.08,0:19:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then it's time to withdraw.\NThe mission is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.08,0:19:34.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,From there, we anonymously donated the money here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.63,0:19:37.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I assumed the shop would be up and running again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.21,0:19:41.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.50,0:19:43.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.83,0:19:45.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I may, why are you closed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.67,0:19:50.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh! If you're worried about that mess I was in,\Nthat all sorted itself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.42,0:19:53.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But my back isn't what it used to be, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.33,0:19:57.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sir! I, um, baked it just like you showed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.58,0:19:59.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what I like to hear!\NI'll be right over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.79,0:20:03.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As you can see, I decided to take on an apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.08,0:20:06.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The shop should be open again before too long,\Nso I hope you can wait a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.71,0:20:07.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.33,0:20:17.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The sample pie I baked will be ready soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.00,0:20:18.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you like to take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.33,0:20:19.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We would love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.83,0:20:23.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I did offer to carry it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.79,0:20:25.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I appreciate the offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.42,0:20:27.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, I'd like to give it to the others myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.79,0:20:30.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really can be stubborn when it comes to the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.25,0:20:34.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's embarrassing to admit,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.38,0:20:37.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I assumed that sooner or later,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.04,0:20:40.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,everyone on the team would develop\Nromantic feelings for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:43.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I figured that someday,\Nwe would all end up fighting over you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.00,0:20:44.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and the team would collapse from within.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.00,0:20:47.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't even say that.\NThat's a horrible thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.71,0:20:52.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But during the break,\Neveryone helped support my love for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.54,0:20:53.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.75,0:20:56.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lamplight really is a wonderful team.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.75,0:22:33.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,W-we've got trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.54,0:22:35.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?\NYou look alarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.88,0:22:39.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,S-so, uh, Thea and the others just stayed\Nbehind at your mission site
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.46,0:22:42.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to clean up a few loose ends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.33,0:22:43.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was the plan, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.96,0:22:45.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They aren't back yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.50,0:22:48.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I tried calling, but they didn't pick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.67,0:22:49.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.88,0:22:54.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Judgin' by your expression,\Nyou didn't see this coming either.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.04,0:22:57.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,D-did something happen to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.33,0:23:12.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.21,0:23:17.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, what's it going to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.17,0:23:19.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.38,0:23:20.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.46,0:23:22.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're short on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.63,0:23:25.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.00,0:23:27.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you going to betray Lamplight?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.13,0:23:30.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If so, I'd appreciate it if you told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.96,0:23:34.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll need some time to dispose of your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.46,0:00:52.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(307.2,576)}{\an7}Several Weeks Ago, After the First Mission
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.25,0:00:59.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(652.8,612)}{\an7}FILE: Daughter Dearest Grete
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.50,0:10:16.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(652.8,144)}{\an7}FILE: Daughter Dearest Grete
